config QDEC_GD32
	bool "GD32 timer quadrature decoder"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_GD_GD32_QDEC_ENABLED
	select PINCTRL
	select USE_GD32_TIMER
	help
	  Enable the GD32 timer quadrature decoder sensor driver.

	  The timer reports wraps through a single sticky update flag, which does
	  not latch the number of wraps or their direction. The driver samples
	  TIMER_CNT before clearing the flag; a wrap arriving after the clear
	  re-asserts the flag and is handled separately. A wrap arriving in the
	  short window between the counter sample and the flag clear coalesces
	  with the pending one and cannot be reconstructed in software. Opposite
	  wraps that coalesce before servicing cannot be reconstructed either, so
	  the update interrupt must be serviced at least once per half of the
	  16-bit counter range.
